      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We saw this and other locomotion schemes when we were developing VRChat. We tried out a bunch of things. It'd be nice to include all sorts of options but at the time (and even now) we have lots to get done and limited resources to do it all. So, the decision was made to go with the two movement mechanics \"free move\" and \"holoport\". At some point we may open up the locomotion to more types but not sure when that will be just yet. I understand this option might be interesting for some people to try. Thanks for the suggestion.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
