  "details": "In a nutshell, hold a button down, your heading is frozen, idea is that you turn around and continue walking, this would be interesting with full body tracking, if you want a better idea of what i'm talking about here's a few videos... \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pW6nlLV88Zk\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mPmP1HuKpnw\nNOTE: This would work best with a large playspace...",
